9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/extras/f8bf3be6bca9d5de1cf9579ad46418f5.mp4?t=1771364515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726\u00a0<u>Character Bonding</u>:</strong> Experience heartwarming bonding moments with your teammates. Their lives are intertwined with yours, and their struggles, their laughter, and their sacrifices will resonate with you long after you\u2019ve put the game down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/extras/5d7bf7451473c69cead786a020d12ea0.webp?t=1771364515\" width=600 height=50 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>STARWEAVE</i></strong>, every decision, every interaction, every step taken can tip the scale of destiny. With every choice, you will come closer to the truth - the truth of who you are, who you were meant to be, and who you choose to become. Stand strong against the tides of fate and weave your own starry path. Your journey awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/extras/ba970b163a13c146cb28b012a6316430.poster.avif?t=1771364515\" width=150 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/extras/ba970b163a13c146cb28b012a6316430.webm?t=1771364515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/extras/ba970b163a13c146cb28b012a6316430.mp4?t=1771364515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"b