1364515","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/aeefbfb631aeebf897ff4f3e064867af6983d6c1/ss_aeefbfb631aeebf897ff4f3e064867af6983d6c1.600x338.jpg?t=1771364515"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/1b4bf4b0bc7421c2e674ca44fc41874f6fc2979b/ss_1b4bf4b0bc7421c2e674ca44fc41874f6fc2979b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771364515","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/1b4bf4b0bc7421c2e674ca44fc41874f6fc2979b/ss_1b4bf4b0bc7421c2e674ca44fc41874f6fc2979b.600x338.jpg?t=1771364515"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58/ss_0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771364515","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200060/0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58/ss_0544b2df171251038acd04fcb9874b4fb2fdee58.600x338.jpg?t=1771364515"}],"short_description":"Set out on your destined quest in this narrative RPG with turn-based tactics. Issue commands, light Beacons, exercise compassion. Take heed, for your roles shall constrict, and your tale was always meant to be bittersweet. Who will the stars dictate we be?","steam_appid":2200060,"support_info":{"email":"starweavedevupdates@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}